type: software
title: "Interactive Child Quiz & Knowledge Assessment System"
abstract: >
  Learning Fun! is an open-source, touch-screen web application designed for
  preschool teachers and parents to administer interactive quiz sessions to
  children aged 4–6. Questions are delivered via text-to-speech audio; children
  respond by tapping large emoji or image cards on any device. The system
  supports two evidence-informed data-collection modes — a correctness-enforced
  "Find the Answer" mode and an open-ended "Free Choice" mode — and records
  response accuracy, attempt count, and response time (ms) per question for
  downstream analysis. All session data is stored as JSONL and exportable as CSV
  through a password-protected admin dashboard. The tool is designed for use in
  early childhood education research, cognitive assessment studies, and classroom
  formative assessment.
